🎯 Why String Methods Matter?

✔ Simplify text processing
✔ Used in form validation
✔ Essential in coding problems

---

⚠️ Common Mistakes

❌ Using `==` instead of `equals()`
❌ Invalid indexes in `substring()`
❌ Forgetting strings are immutable

